== @SC:lo <sec:algos_sc>

In search of faster solutions, @SC was the 
most promising algorithm we encountered @trees_with_spa_col.
Thus it became the main subject and 
was examined under @sec:artifact_sc.

@SC is lenient when it comes to choice of data structures, 
which led to interesting findings, see @sec:algos_sc_speed.
Reacting to the environment also comes naturally, see @sec:future_env.
